      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effect of peptide Semax on remodeling of cardiac sympathetic innervation was examined in rats with experimental myocardial infarction. In 28 days after ischemia/reperfusion injury, Semax diminished the growth of sympathetic innervation of ventricular septum, although it produced no effect on the density of β1 and β2 adrenoceptors."},
